[ ] Make freshness worktree-relative =contextual-freshness $Fix contextual overwrite per knowledge/specifications/contextual-coordination-contract.md sections 1-2,6. Acceptance CC1 green; CC2 retained/adapted as legacy characterization. Bounded status/delta name context; claim/evidence/finding assessments remain independent across linked worktrees; restart/legacy replay preserve honest attribution and single-worktree semantics. Soundness fix proceeds before pilot independently of later entity selection.$ !1 +implementation ^2026-09-13T22:19 <coordination-contract #01a09e5a-f70e-7e22-996e-974957d84e4b
