[ ] Prove swarm coordination across harnesses and worktrees =coordination-dogfood $After pilot selection and selected implementation, prove the chosen design on consequential foreign-repository work with two harnesses and linked worktrees. Cite knowledge/specifications/contextual-coordination-contract.md CC1,CC6-CC8 where applicable and charter walking skeleton. Selection must revise action/predecessors if entities are rejected, not silently skip required coverage. Include producer/consumer discovery, replacement-session handoff, Git verification and local reassessment with request/response MCP. Reuse short protocol probes: wrong-but-current belief, impossible task, peer scope expansion and misreported observation in disposable state only; no claim of perception authentication. Report reliance, duplication, recap burden, false-current/false-stale, attribution gaps, bypasses, bookkeeping, latency and cost against pilot observations. Retain failures and publish keep/change/reject findings, not general superiority.$ !2 +evaluation ^2026-09-13T22:19 <coordination-handoff <coordination-selection #01a09e5b-51d9-74d2-8c54-6cbe91a747ec
